common-passwords.txt is a subset (the first 10,000 entries of at least 8
characters, lower-cased) of Passwords/Common-Credentials/
100k-most-used-passwords-NCSC.txt from SecLists
(https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists). That list is the UK National
Cyber Security Centre's "PwnedPasswordsTop100k", the most common passwords
in Troy Hunt's Have I Been Pwned Pwned Passwords (https://haveibeenpwned.com).

